:: Pound Free
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "key">>
<<endevent>>
<<loadNPC 0 "black_dog">>
The key is in its usual place. There's nothing stopping you from unlocking the cage, and holding it wide open for the <<beasttype>> within. <<bHis>> yellow eyes appear in the dark. <<bHe 0>> regards you a moment, before stepping into the light.
<br><br>

<<bHe>> stops near the doorway, then looks past you towards the exit.
<br><br>

<<link [[Reassure|Pound Free Reassure]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Lead outside|Pound Free Lead]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Pound Free Reassure
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I-I'm here to rescue you," you say. "Please don't be frightened."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I-I'm here to help," you say, stopping just outside <<bhis>> reach. "Can you come with me?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'm here to get you out," you say. "Please come with me, and stay close."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm here to help," you say. "I'll go slowly. Just come with me."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm getting you out," you say. "Stay close."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"I'm getting you out of here," you say. "Come on, before someone notices."
<<else>>
	"I'm freeing you," you say. "Come on. We need to hurry."
<</if>>
<br><br>

You step back from the cage door and give the <<beasttype 0>> room to move.
<<if $monster is 1>>
	"I follow," <<bhe>> says. "Then I run for forest. Never return here."
<<else>>
	<<bHe>> gets to <<bhis>> feet, stretches, then moves to your side.
<</if>>
There's a new energy about <<bhim>>.
<br><br>

