:: Pound Free 3
<<effects>>
<<bind>>
There's no chance of victory. You can't even see the blow that sends you to the ground, a weight keeps you there. "Got <<phim>>," says a <<person3>><<personssimple>> voice. "Where'd the mutt go?"
<br>
There's a pause. "Where'd it go?"
<br>
"Sorry sarge. <span class="green">It's gone.</span>"
<br>
"Fuck. Get this <<bitch>> inside."
