	"The <span class="purple">brute</span> savaged <<bhis 0>> master," says a <<person3>><<person>>, stopping beside you and folding <<his>> arms. "Now the master wants revenge. Needs us to knock some obedience into the mutt first though. No one can even get a collar on."
	<br><br>
	The <<person2>><<person>> escapes the cage and slams the door behind <<him>>. <<He>> carries part of the collar. The rest has been torn off. "I ain't going near it," the <<person3>><<person>> laughs.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Pound]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $pound.progress is 2 and $pound.status gte 10>>
	<<set $pound.progress to 3>>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>
	<<generate2>><<person2>>
	You hear a whimper. A <<person>> stands over a <<beasttype 0>> in one of the cages, whacking <<bhim 0>> with a belt. The <<beasttype 0>> doesn't try to defend <<bhimself 0>>.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Intervene|Pound Work Intervene]]>><<pound_status 3>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<ggpound_status>><<gstray_happiness>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Ignore|Pound Work Intervene Ignore]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $slimePoundIgnored>>
		You ignore the ear slime's command and choose how you want to work.
		<<unset $slimePoundIgnored>>
		<br><br>
		<<stray_happiness_text>>
	<<elseif $slimePoundDefy>>
		<<if $earSlime.corruption gte (currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10)>>
			<<set $earSlime.defyCooldown += 2>>
			The slime tries to assert control. <span class="red">It overpowers your will,</span> forcing you to do what it wants.
			<<ggwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
			<br><br>
			<<earSlimePoundLinks>>
		<<else>>
			You try to ignore the command from the slime and continue on. You feel it try, <span class="green">but fail,</span> to force you to work in a specific way.
			<br><br>
			<<stray_happiness_text>>
			<<unset $slimePoundDefy>>
			<<unset $slimePoundTask>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		Other staff go about their business. A <<person>> enters a metal door on the other side of the building, locking it behind <<him>>.
		<<endevent>>
		<br><br>
		<<stray_happiness_text>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $slimePoundDefy>>
		<<unset $slimePoundDefy>>
	<<elseif !$daily.earSlimePoundTask and numberOfEarSlime() and earSlimeMakingMundaneRequests() and random(0,100) gte 75>>
		<br><br>
		<<set $daily.earSlimePoundTask to true>>
		<<set _slimePoundTask to ["Sweep"]>>
		<<if $pound.status gte 10>><<run _slimePoundTask.push("Feed")>><</if>>
		<<if $pound.status gte 20>><<run _slimePoundTask.push("Brush")>><</if>>
		<<if $pound.status gte 40>><<run _slimePoundTask.push("Wash")>><</if>>
		<<if $pound.status gte 60>><<run _slimePoundTask.push("Walk")>><</if>>
		<<set $slimePoundTask to _slimePoundTask.random()>>
		<span @class="$earSlime.startedThreats ? 'lewd' : 'lblue'">You feel the slime in your head command you to <<print $slimePoundTask.toLowerCase()>>
		<<if $slimePoundTask is "Sweep">>
			the floor.
		<<else>>
			the dogs.
		<</if>>
		</span> It promises rewards if you comply<<if $earSlime.startedThreats>> and threatens consequences if you do not<</if>>.
		<br><br>
		<<earSlimePoundLinks "Obey">>
		<br>
		<<if $earSlime.startedThreats>>
			<<link [[Defy|Pound Work]]>><<set $slimePoundDefy to true>><<corruption -1>><<pain 8>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><<def 1>><</link>><<lcorruption>><<ggpain>><<ggtrauma>><<ggstress>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Ignore|Pound Work]]>><<unset $slimePoundTask>><<set $slimePoundIgnored to true>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<br><br>
		<<choreicon "sweep">><<link [[Sweep (£5)|Pound Work Sweep]]>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("sweep")>><<stray_happiness 1>><<set $pound.tasks.push("sweep")>><</if>><<set $pound.money to 5>><</link>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("sweep")>><<gstray_happiness>><</if>>
		<br>
		<<if $pound.status gte 10>>
			<<petshopicon "dog food">><<link [[Feed (£8)|Pound Work Feed]]>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("feed")>><<stray_happiness 1>><<set $pound.tasks.push("feed")>><</if>><<set $pound.money to 8>><</link>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("feed")>><<gstray_happiness>><</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<petshopicon "dog food">><span class="blue">The <<pound_text>> don't respect you enough to let you near them, even with food.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<if $pound.status gte 20>>
			<<petshopicon "brush">><<link [[Brush (£10)|Pound Work Brush]]>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("brush")>><<stray_happiness 2>><<set $pound.tasks.push("brush")>><</if>><<set $pound.money to 10>><</link>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("brush")>><<ggstray_happiness>><</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<petshopicon "brush">><span class="blue">The <<pound_text>> don't respect you enough to let you near them with a brush.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<if $pound.status gte 40>>
			<<choreicon "wash">><<link [[Wash (£12)|Pound Work Wash]]>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("wash")>><<stray_happiness 2>><<set $pound.tasks.push("wash")>><</if>><<set $pound.money to 12>><</link>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("wash")>><<ggstray_happiness>><</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<choreicon "wash">><span class="blue">The <<pound_text>> don't respect you enough to let you near them with a bucket of water.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<if $pound.status gte 60>>
			<<petshopicon "dog leash">><<link [[Walk (£15)|Pound Work Walk]]>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("walk")>><<stray_happiness 3>><<set $pound.tasks.push("walk")>><</if>><<set $pound.money to 15>><</link>><<if !$pound.tasks.includes("walk")>><<gggstray_happiness>><</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<petshopicon "dog leash">><span class="blue">The <<pound_text>> don't respect you enough to let you near them with a leash.</span>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<if !$slimePoundTask>>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Pound]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Pound Work Intervene
<<effects>>

You hurry to the cage and grab the door. The rattle of metal makes the nearest <<pound_text>> flinch.

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Stop it," you say. "Y-You're hurting <<bhim 0>>."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"P-Please stop," you say. "You've hurt <<bhim 0>> enough."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"That's enough," you say. "Put the belt down, please."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Please stop," you say. "You don't need to hit <<bhim 0>> again."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Stop," you say. "Put the belt down."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Put the belt down," you say. "You've done enough."
<<else>>
	"Stop it," you say. "You're hurting <<bhim 0>>."
<</if>>
<br><br>

The <<person>> looks at you, then gives the <<beasttype 0>> one last whack before lowering the belt. The other cages have gone quiet. "All right," <<he>> says, breathing hard. <<He>> steps out of the cage, but stops beside you. "<span class="pink">Best watch out, <<lass>>.</span> Don't think we won't make a <<bitch>> of you if you give us a reason."
<br><br>

<<if Time.hour gte $closinghour>>
	<<link [[Next|Pound]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Pound Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>



:: Pound Work Intervene Ignore
<<effects>>

You keep walking, and try your best to ignore the whimpering.
<br><br>

<<if Time.hour gte $closinghour>>
	<<link [[Next|Pound]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Pound Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>



:: Pound Work Sweep
<<effects>>
<<if $slimePoundTask>>You follow the <<= numberOfEarSlime() gte 2 ? "slimes'" : "slime's">> command to do a specific task.<<unset $slimePoundTask>><</if>>

You take a broom and
<<switch random(1,2)>>
	<<case 1>>sweep fur from the cages. Once in a neat pile, you sweep it into a dustpan.
	<<case 2>>begin to clean the cages. You sweep clumps of fur into neat piles before pushing it into the dustpan.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>
<<if random(1, 3) is 3>>
	The broom snags as a <<beasttype>> grabs it between <<bhis>> teeth.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Scold|Pound Work Sweep Scold]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 200>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wrestle|Pound Work Sweep Wrestle]]>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 6000>>
	<br>
<<elseif random(1, 2) is 2>>
	While attending to a corner of a cage, you see a <<beasttype>> walk over to the dustpan. <<bHe>> sniffs it and paws at the handle.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Keep cleaning|Pound Work Sweep Mess]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Tell off|Pound Work Sweep Stop]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 200>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	<<endevent>><<generate1>><<person1>>
	A <<person>> grasps the handle as you pass by, stopping you. <<He>> moves in, resting a hand on your <<bottom>>.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	"Let me show you how to sweep properly," <<he>> says, stepping closer still.
	<<if $NPCList[0].penissize gte 3>>
		You feel <<his>> <<print $NPCList[0].penisdesc>> press against you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $anxiety gte 2>>
		<span class="red">Panic strikes,</span> and you lash out at the <<person>>. You hear a cry of pain and see a flash of crimson as <<he>> releases <<his>> grip. You flee to a solitary spot in the yard. You wait until your breathing calms. You don't think you hurt <<him>> too badly.<<severe_anxiety_disorder_text>><<crime "assault">><<crimeUp 10 "assault">>
		<br><br>

		<<poundEndEvent true>>
	<<elseif $anxiety gte 1>>
		<span class="red">Panic strikes,</span> and you freeze in fear. The <<person>> takes it for assent.<<anxiety_disorder_text>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Pound Work Sweep Go]]>><</link>><<if $tending lt 200>><<gtending>><</if>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Go along with it|Pound Work Sweep Go]]>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<if $tending lt 200>><<gtending>><</if>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Shove|Pound Work Sweep Shove]]>><<pound_status 1>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gpound_status>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<wearProp "broom">>

:: Pound Work Sweep Go
<<effects>>

The <<person>> presses <<his>> body awfully close as <<he>> holds your arms and demonstrates <<his>> sweeping technique. <<He>> also talks about the <<pound_text>>, and how to put them at ease.

<<if $tending lt 200>>
	You learn a thing or two, despite <<his>> creepiness. "No need to thank me," <<he>> says, giving your <<bottom>> a parting smack.<<tending 2>>
<<else>>
	<<Hes>> very sure of <<himself>>, but doesn't teach anything you don't already know. "No need to thank me," <<he>> says, giving your <<bottom>> a parting smack.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Shove
<<effects>>

You plant both hands against the <<person>>'s chest and shove. <<He>> stumbles back a step, glares at you, then looks towards the supervisor. After a pause, <<he>> backs off instead of coming at you again.
<br><br>

A few of the <<pound_text>> have stopped what they're doing to watch. When nothing else happens, they turn away.
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Scold
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please let go," you say, keeping both hands on the broom.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"L-Let go, please," you say, pulling the broom towards you.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Let go, please," you say. "I need the broom."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please let go," you say. "You can chew something else."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Drop it," you say, giving the broom a short tug.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Oi. Drop it," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Let go," you say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	The <<beasttype>> keeps <<bhis>> teeth on the broom for another second, then lets go. <span class="green">You pull it free before <<bhe>> changes <<bhis>> mind.</span> <<bHe>> turns to chew on one of the bars instead.<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please let go," you say, tugging carefully at the broom.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"L-Let go," you say, but the next hard pull nearly takes the broom from your hands.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Let go, please," you say, trying to pull the broom back.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please," you say. "I need that back."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Drop it," you say, planting your feet and pulling.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Give it back," you snap, pulling hard.
	<<else>>
		"Let go," you say, pulling the broom towards you.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<span class="red">The <<beasttype>> jerks <<bhis>> head from side to side until your grip slips.</span> <<bHe>> chews the broom until <<bhe>> gets bored, then drops it with teeth marks along the wood.<<lpound_status>><<pound_status -1>><<if $tending lt 200>><<tending 1>><<gtending>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Wrestle
<<effects>>

<<if $physiqueSuccess>>
	You push a foot against the bars for purchase, and twist the shaft <span class="green">as you pull the handle from the <<beasttype>>'s mouth.</span> <<bHe>> lies down, dejected.<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
<<else>>
	You push a foot against the bar for purchase, <span class="red">but the <<beasttype>> pulls you off balance,</span> smacking your shoulder against the metal. <<bHe>> only gives up <<bhis>> grip when satisfied, leaving teeth marks on the wood.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Mess
<<effects>>

The <<beasttype>> knocks over the dustpan, spilling the contents back onto the floor. <<bHe>> starts playing with the bits of fur before you can stop <<bhim>>, flinging debris everywhere.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
<br><br>
The <<beasttype>> eventually tires and walks away, leaving behind a huge mess. You try to clean it up the best you can, but it takes some effort to clean a second time.<<tiredness 6>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Sweep Stop
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"Please leave that alone," you say, stepping between the <<beasttype>> and the dustpan.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"P-Please don't," you say, moving in front of the dustpan.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Leave that alone, please," you say, blocking <<bhis>> path.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please don't make another mess," you say, reaching for the dustpan.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Leave it," you say, stepping in front of <<bhim>>.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Hey. Leave it alone," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Don't touch that," you say, stepping between <<bhim>> and the dustpan.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		The <<beasttype>> lowers <<bhis>> head and walks away. "Mean human..." <<bhe>> says. "Just playing..."
	<<else>>
		The <<beasttype>> lowers <<bhis>> head and walks away with a quiet whine.
	<</if>>
	<<pound_status 1>><<gpound_status>>
	<br><br>

	You pick up the dustpan before another <<beasttype>> gets interested, then finish cleaning the cage.
	<br><br>

<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"P-Please stop," you say, hurrying towards the dustpan.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"D-Don't," you say, reaching for it.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Leave that alone, please," you say, moving towards <<bhim>>.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please don't," you say. "I just cleaned that."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Leave it," you say, reaching for the dustpan.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Oi, knock it off," you say.
	<<else>>
		"Don't do that," you say, reaching for the dustpan.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	The <<beasttype>> ignores you and knocks the dustpan over before you can grab it. Fur and dirt scatter across the floor, and <<bhe>> bats the mess around while you try to stop <<bhim>>.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	By the time <<bhe>> loses interest, you have almost as much to clean as before. You gather everything up again, taking care to keep the dustpan out of reach.<<tiredness 6>><<gtiredness>><<pound_status -1>><<lpound_status>>
	<br><br>

<</if>>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Feed
<<effects>><<wearProp "dog bowl">>
<<if $slimePoundTask>>You follow the <<= numberOfEarSlime() gte 2 ? "slimes'" : "slime's">> command to do a specific task.<<unset $slimePoundTask>><</if>>
You refill the bowls in the rear courtyard, before a horde of eager <<pound_text>> are released from their cages.
<br><br>

<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
	They swarm towards the bowls, ignoring you and the other staff.
	<<beastNEWinit 2 dog>>
	An emaciated <<beasttype 0>> tries to push <<bhis 0>> way through, but is too weak. Another <<beasttype 1>> jostles <<bhim 0>> aside. <<bHe 0>> lies down, defeated.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Make the others play fair|Pound Work Feed Soothe]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 400>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Comfort|Pound Work Feed Comfort]]>><<stress 6>><<trauma -6>><</link>><<gstress>><<ltrauma>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Do nothing|Pound Work Feed Nothing]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	They devour the food in moments, and seem to be grateful to you personally for the feast.<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<poundEndEvent>>
<</if>>


:: Pound Work Feed Soothe
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $tendingSuccess>>
	You crouch beside the <<beasttype 1>> and scratch gently behind <<bhis 1>> ear.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"Will you let your friend have some?" you ask. "There's enough."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"C-Could you move over a little?" you ask. "Your friend needs to eat too."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Let your friend eat too, please," you say. "There's enough for both of you."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please share," you say, keeping your hand against <<bhis 1>> fur. "Just make a little room."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Move over," you say. "Let <<bhim 0>> eat."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Come on, move over," you say. "You're not eating all of it."
	<<else>>
		"Let your friend have some," you say. "There's enough for both of you."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $monster is 1>>
		<span class="green">The <<beasttype 1>> leans into your hand, then shifts aside.</span> <<bHe 1>> stays beside the bowl while the <<beasttype 0>> eats, keeping the other <<pound_text>> away. When <<bhe 0>> finishes, <<bhe 0>> licks your hand.
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">The <<beasttype 1>> is soothed by your touch,</span> and allows the <<beasttype 0>> to feed beside <<bhim 1>>. <<bHe 0>> eats <<bhis 0>> fill, and collapses in satisfaction.
	<</if>>
	<<gpound_status>><<pound_status 1>>
<<else>>
	You crouch beside the <<beasttype 1>> and reach towards <<bhis 1>> ear, <span class="red">but <<bhe 1>> snaps at your hand.</span> You pull back before <<bhe 1>> can bite you, while the other staff laugh.<<lpound_status>><<pound_status -1>><<if $tending lt 400>><<tending 1>><<gtending>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Feed Comfort
<<effects>>

You wait beside the <<beasttype 0>> until the others move away from the bowls, then crouch and stroke <<bhis 0>> back. <<bHe 0>> stays close to your leg while the last scraps disappear.
<br><br>

When the other <<pound_text>> are done, <<bhe 0>> steps forward and licks each bowl clean. You keep your hand on <<bhis 0>> back until <<bhes 0>> finished.
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Feed Nothing
<<effects>>

You watch the feeding frenzy with the other staff. The <<beasttype 0>> licks the bowls clean.
<br><br>

<<poundEndEvent>>

:: Pound Work Brush
<<effects>>

<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>><<wearProp "brush">>
<<if $slimePoundTask>>You follow the <<= numberOfEarSlime() gte 2 ? "slimes'" : "slime's">> command to do a specific task.<<unset $slimePoundTask>><</if>>
Brush in hand, you enter one of the cages.
<br><br>

<<cleareventpool>>
<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled or $monster is 1>>
	<<addinlineevent "pound_brush_1">>
		The <<beasttype>> inside is friendly. Perhaps too friendly.
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			<<bHe>> wraps <<bhis>> arms around your waist, and humps your thigh.
		<<else>>
			<<bHe>> rears on <<bhis>> hind legs, and humps your thigh.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Tell off|Pound Work Brush Tell]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 600>>
		<br>
		<<if hasSexStat("deviancy", 2)>>
			<<link [[Allow|Pound Work Brush Allow]]>><</link>><<deviant2>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "pound_brush_2">>
	The <<beasttype>> inside greets you with a low growl.<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Soothe|Pound Work Brush Soothe]]>><</link>><<tendingdifficulty 1 600>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Find a gentler creature to brush|Pound Work Brush Find]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled or $monster is 1>>
		<<link [[Act like a dog to put it at ease|Pound Work Brush Act]]>><</link>><<deviant1>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
