The <<beasttype 0>> pushes <<bhis 0>> nose into the flower, <span class="lewd">sending pollen over the grass.</span> The sweet smell reaches you a second later, followed by a rush of heat through your body.<<ggarousal>><<arousal 1200>><<drugs 120>>
<br><br>

Your knees weaken. The <<beastsplural>> begin sniffing and licking at you, just as affected, and you have to shorten the leashes to keep them close. Part of you wants to stop pulling them back and lie down in the grass.
