:: Pound Work Walk Ask
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "dog leash">>
You stay behind a small group of trees near the street, keeping the trunks between yourself and anyone passing. The <<beastsplural>> shift around your legs and pull at their leashes.
<br><br>

A <<generate6>><<person6>><<person>> walks by.
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"E-Excuse me," you call. "I've had an accident. Could you give me something to cover with?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"E-Excuse me," you call from behind the trees. "Could you spare something to cover me?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Excuse me," you call. "I've had an accident. Could you lend me something to cover myself?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Please," you call. "I need something to cover myself."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Hey," you call. "Could you lend me something to cover up with?"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Hey," you call. "Had an accident. Got anything I can cover up with?"
<<else>>
	"Hello," you call. "I've had an accident. Could you give me something to cover with?"
<</if>>
<br><br>
The <<person>> stops and looks towards the trees. The trunks hide most of your body,
<<upperwear "overalls">>
<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
	but <<he>> leans to one side, trying to see more. "Sure," <<he>> says. "I live nearby. Give me a few minutes, and I'll bring you something."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> returns with a set of overalls folded over one arm. "All I have that'll fit you," <<he>> says, holding them out. You reach from behind the tree and snatch them from <<his>> hand. The fabric feels cold against your fingers.
	<br><br>

	You pull the overalls on behind the trees. They're cold all over, but you have nothing else to wear. The <<person>> is still waiting when you step out, grinning as <<he>> watches you head towards the pound.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Pound Work Walk Ask 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	but <<he>> blushes and looks away. "S-sure," <<he>> says. "I live nearby. Give me a few minutes, and I'll bring you something."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> returns as promised, holding a set of overalls. "Sorry it's not more comfortable," <<he>> says, holding it out with eyes averted. "It's all I have in your size. It should get you where you're going."
	<br><br>

	You thank the <<person>> and dress behind the trees. By the time you step back onto the street, <<he>> has already left.
	<br><br>

	The journey back to the pound is uneventful, though a few people look twice at the oversized overalls.
	<br><br>

	<<endcombat>>
	You make <<wage $pound.money "tending" "bird" 0.45>>.
	<br><br>

	<<if Time.hour gte $closinghour>>
		<<link [[Next|Pound]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Pound Work]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<wearProp "dog leash">>



:: Pound Work Walk Ask 2
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "dog leash">>
You turn onto another street, this one more crowded. You smell a whiff of raw meat. Odd, as there are no butchers you know of near here. You get another whiff, then another. Soon the smell of meat becomes constant.
<br><br>

You jump when a nose presses into your groin from behind. The <<beasttype 0>> sniffs at the overalls, and the others crowd closer to do the same. When <<bhe 0>> starts licking your bottom, you pull one of the straps towards your face and sniff it. <span class="pink">The fabric reeks of raw meat.</span>
<br><br>

The <<beasttype 0>> grasps part of the fabric between <<bhis 0>> teeth, <span class="pink">tearing it.</span> You tighten <<bhis 0>> leash and pull <<bhim 0>> away, but you're attracting glances from other pedestrians.
<br><br>

<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 50>>
<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 50>>


<<link [[Next|Pound Work Walk Ask 3]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Pound Work Walk Ask 3
<<effects>>
<<wearProp "dog leash">>
You hasten your pace. You're not strong enough to keep them all at bay, not when they're so eager. You're able to chasten the worst of them, but can't stop them all from nipping and biting.
<br><br>

You glance over your shoulder. A few people follow in amusement, the <<person>> among them.
<br><br>

<<set $worn.upper.integrity -= 50>>
<<set $worn.lower.integrity -= 50>>



