The other staff laugh and leer as you enter the building. You snatch some cleaned towels from a trolley near the entrance. You <<if $upperwet gte 1>>dry<<else>>cover<</if>> yourself in a hurry, then return the <<beastsplural>> to their cages. <<dry_towel>>
